# Chapter 6's login case: open login, request a code, enter it, and the account and the route change.
# The services are fakes: each request is held until `clock data release` answers it from a recording.
tree
tap home.login
type account.email you@example.com
tap account.submit
state account.waiting
clock data release auth.email_start
state account.step
type account.code 123456
tap account.verify
clock data release auth.email_verify
clock data release auth.account
state
state account.who
tree
